      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Only exposing the selected URL seems much easier to understand. I don't see a strong use case for reflecting all the exact input of the options dictionaries, so I don't expect us to add that. Note that we already didn't expose the exact input of the icon urls, we reflected the result of resolving with baseURL.\n\nAlso, by using an interface with readonly attributes, I don't think we need to freeze the object anymore, which was a strange wrinkle.\n",
